(text "Fingers, top side, 2.54 mm pitch.\n1 GND is longest: mates first, breaks last.\n8 DETECT is shortest and tied to GND here:\nthe console's GP7 pull-up reads low only at\nfull depth, and only then does it switch\nVCC on (GP6). 6 is the keying slot.\n7 RST is for a Trust M key.\nNo I2C pull-ups on the key: they are on the\nconsole, to switched VCC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "39959180-c2e8-4a8b-a3e1-36007d25ebc4"))
